data: {"id": "465e16cc95eb4118-thinking-parallel_evidence-2808", "run_id": "465e16cc95eb4118", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "让我整理已采集的证据，针对 `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` 的 `CurrentStateVerification` 进行根因分析。\n\n## 实体确认\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| **Pod** | `workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` |\n| **Namespace** | `aiops-case-10` |\n| **UID** | `b1c01c93-0091-4506-bcbd-69cfd75e0f12` |\n| **Node** | `node2` |\n| **Pod IP** | `172.16.104.31` |\n| **容器** | `app` |\n| **镜像** | `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine` |\n| **控制器** | ReplicaSet `workload-79d9f8fd88` |\n| **创建时间** | `2026-09-03T20:09:25Z` |\n\n---\n\n## 已采集事", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788467639767, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

